        "standfirst": "<p><em>How we think about skin, and how we show our working.</em></p>",
        "intro": "<p>This part of the site sets out the thinking behind the products: how we think about skin, what goes into the bottle, and how we decide what to claim. Each page links to the detail, and the detail links to its sources.</p>",
        "hero_image_alt": "Rock pool at low tide on the north Devon coast",
        "hero_image_reserve": true,
        "living_heading": "Skin is a living system",
        "living_body": "<p>Your skin is a living system, home to bacteria and other microbes that help keep the barrier working. Most of the time it knows what it is doing.</p><p>So we build products to support that system rather than override it. Support, not control. Each page below sets out the reasoning and the sources, so you can check it for yourself.</p>",
